# F-Droid requirements (mandatory for NCarousel)

This app is submitted to F-Droid with **`Binaries`** + **`AllowedAPKSigningKeys`** (upstream-signed reproducible APK). The agent **MUST** keep the repo compliant; do not remove or weaken these constraints without explicit user opt-out.

Cross-rules: **`.cursor/rules/63-fdroid-authority-binding.mdc`** (F-Droid docs/master = binding), **`.cursor/rules/60-fdroiddata-scope-ncarousel.mdc`**, **`.cursor/rules/61-fdroiddata-ncarousel-metadata-consistency.mdc`**, **`docs/FDROID.md`**.

## 1. `app/build.gradle.kts` (non-negotiable)

Keep all of the following in the `android { }` block:

```kotlin
dependenciesInfo {
    includeInApk = false
    includeInBundle = false
}
```

**Why:** F-Droid’s scanner **fails** release APKs with an extra APK Signing Block **“Dependency metadata”** (AGP default). This is required for `Binaries:` recipes.

Also required (do not regress):

- **`ncarouselLocalVersionCode`**: monotonic; bump on every release-ready publish.
- **`ncarouselBaseVersionName`**: bump on every release-ready publish (at least patch).
- **F-Droid `checkupdates` literals in `defaultConfig`** (fdroidserver regex only; does **not** run Gradle). Keep **both**, then the dynamic overrides:

```kotlin
versionCode = <ncarouselLocalVersionCode>   // digits only; must equal ncarouselLocalVersionCode
versionCode = ncarouselVersionCode
versionName = "<ncarouselBaseVersionName>"  // quoted string; must equal ncarouselBaseVersionName (no "v" prefix)
versionName = ncarouselVersionName
```

  **On every version bump**, update **`ncarouselBaseVersionName`**, **`ncarouselLocalVersionCode`**, **and** these two literal lines in the **same** commit. If `versionName` has no quoted literal, Tags checkupdates falls back to the git tag name (`v0.2.x`) and bot MRs get a wrong `Builds.versionName` / `CurrentVersion`.
- **`NCAROUSEL_PUBLISH_RELEASE_APK`**: stable `versionName` / `versionCode` on CI `assembleRelease` (see workflow).
- **CI release signing** (`enableV1Signing` + v2/v3) when `NCAROUSEL_SIGNING_*` is set — required for sideload and must match `AllowedAPKSigningKeys`.

## 2. `.github/workflows/android-ci.yml` (non-negotiable)

- Set **`NCAROUSEL_PUBLISH_RELEASE_APK=true`** for `assembleRelease` when the CI keystore is configured.
- When git tag **`v<ncarouselBaseVersionName>`** already exists **and** `NCarousel-<version>.apk` is already on the GitHub Release, **do not** replace that release APK (only refresh `-debug.apk`). Exception: asset missing → upload once for recovery.
- **Do not** push to `main` without bumping `ncarouselBaseVersionName` if the change would rebuild and re-upload the **release** APK for the same tag (breaks `Builds.commit` / VCS metadata alignment).

## 3. `fdroiddata` metadata (non-negotiable when versioning for F-Droid)

After **green** CI and **`NCarousel-<version>.apk`** on GitHub Releases:

1. Update **`../fdroiddata/metadata/dev.nemeyes.ncarousel.yml`** only (see rule 61).
2. **`Builds.commit`**: `git rev-parse "v<version>^{commit}"` — **never** plain `git rev-parse v<version>` (annotated **tag object** hash breaks builds).
3. **`Builds.versionName` / `versionCode` / `CurrentVersion*`** must match `app/build.gradle.kts` at that commit.
4. **`Binaries`**: `https://github.com/myNemy/NCarousel/releases/download/v%v/NCarousel-%v.apk` (release only, not `-debug`).
5. **`AllowedAPKSigningKeys`**: SHA-256 of the CI release cert (64 hex lowercase); must match the published release APK.
6. **Commit + `git push myNemy NCarousel`** — F-Droid work is incomplete until push succeeds.

Verify: `git cat-file -t <hash>` → `commit`; `git ls-remote https://github.com/myNemy/NCarousel.git <hash>` succeeds.

## 4. Release checklist (agent MUST follow)

| Step | Action |
|------|--------|
| 1 | Bump `ncarouselBaseVersionName` + `ncarouselLocalVersionCode` + **both** `defaultConfig` literals (`versionCode` / `versionName`) + Fastlane changelog |
| 2 | Ensure `dependenciesInfo` remains disabled (section 1) |
| 3 | Commit/push NCarousel → **forgejo** + **origin** |
| 4 | Wait for green **Android CI**; confirm **`NCarousel-<version>.apk`** on GitHub Release |
| 5 | `git rev-parse "v<version>^{commit}"` → set fdroiddata `commit:` |
| 6 | Push fdroiddata branch **`NCarousel`** to **`myNemy`** |

## 5. Forbidden (will fail F-Droid CI)

- Dependency metadata in release APK (`includeInApk = true` or removing `dependenciesInfo` block).
- `Builds.commit` = tag object hash or tag name string.
- `Binaries` pointing at debug APK or wrong version URL.
- `versionCode` only from `1000+GITHUB_RUN_NUMBER` on the **published release** APK.
- Bumping `ncarouselBaseVersionName` / `ncarouselLocalVersionCode` **without** updating the matching `defaultConfig` literals (breaks checkupdates → tag used as `versionName`).
- Updating rule examples or docs **without** syncing real `fdroiddata` when the app version for F-Droid changed.

